Package: xios-gnome
Name: Xios Desktop (GNOME)
Version: 0.1.7
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.5), xios-core (>= 0.1.8), gnome-shell, libmutter-14-0 (>= 46.0+ios9), gnome-session, gnome-settings-daemon, libaccountsservice0, libgdm1 (>= 46.0+ios2), libgeoclue-2-0, libgeocode-glib-2-0, libgweather-4-0 (>= 4.4.2+ios2), libupower-glib3, xios-session-stubs (>= 0.2.9), xios-gnome-typelibs, xios-desktop-theme
Recommends: gnome-console, nautilus, gnome-text-editor, gnome-calculator
MinimumOSVersion: 16.5.0
Description: the GNOME desktop flavor for Xios
 Real GNOME Shell on Mutter 46, running on the iPad GPU through the iosc
 compositor and ANGLE. Installs the full session layer: gnome-session,
 gnome-settings-daemon, dconf, the single-user service stubs (login1,
 PolicyKit, Accounts), the introspection typelibs the shell needs at boot,
 and the Adwaita look (icons, cursors, wallpaper).
 .
 Installing this package is the whole setup: open the Xios app afterwards
 and the GNOME session starts. GNOME apps such as Console, Files, and
 Text Editor are recommended alongside and can be installed individually
 from this repo.
 .
 Needs iOS 16.5 or newer on a rootless jailbreak (/var/jb).
